<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Document</title>
    <script>
        function goFishInfo(){
            window.location.href = '/api/fishinfo';
        }
        function goCommunicate(){
            window.location.href = '/api/community'
        }
        function goTank(){
            window.location.href = '/api/tank';
        }
    </script>
</head>
<body>
    <p>로그인 성공</p>
    <button onclick="goCommunicate()">커뮤니티 화면 이동하기</button>
    <button onclick="goFishInfo()">물고기 정보 이동하기</button>
    <button onclick="goTank()">탱크화면으로 이동하기</button>
    <form action="/api/users/logout" method="post">
        <button>로그이웃</button>
    </form>
</body>
</html>